error[E0277]: `composure::command::Element<ButtonComponent>` cannot go in a `<Container>`
 --> tests/ui/view_button_in_container.rs:4:32
  |
4 |     let _ = rsx! { <Container><Button custom_id="x">"Loose"</Button></Container> };
  |                                ^^^^^^
  |                                |
  |                                `composure::command::Element<ButtonComponent>` doesn't satisfy the trait bound
  |                                the trait `ContainerChild` is not implemented for `composure::command::Element<ButtonComponent>`
  |
  = note: a <Container> takes text, <Text>, <Section>, <Gallery>, <File>, <Separator> and <Row>, components, Views and Props; buttons and selects go in a <Row>
  = help: the following other types implement trait `ContainerChild`:
            composure::command::Element<FileComponent>
            composure::command::Element<composure::types::ActionRow>
            composure::command::Element<composure::types::MediaGallery>
            composure::command::Element<composure::types::Section>
            composure::command::Element<composure::types::Separator>
            composure::command::Element<composure::types::TextDisplay>
